      "title": "Universal Technical Institute-Southern California Factbook",
      "url": "https://www.uti.edu/ir/factbook",
      "summary": "The Universal Technical Institute-Southern California offers a variety of technical programs including Automotive Technology, Diesel & Industrial Technology, Motorcycle Technician, Marine Technician, Collision Repair & Refinish Technology, Electrical & Electronics, Industrial Maintenance, Robotics & Automation, and more. The institute provides information on admissions, tuition, financial aid, and support services. Multiple campuses are located across the U.S., and the institution offers hands-on training with a focus on preparing students for careers in various technical fields. Financial aid and scholarships are available for eligible students. However, employment or salary after graduation cannot be guaranteed by the institution.",
